    bodyEn: "■ Cole Grinde's 15+ List\n\nWhy Tesla is a strong buy right now, per Cole Grinde:\n\n1. Cybercab in Production\n2. Semi in Production\n3. Robotaxi scaling\n4. FSD subscribers growing\n5. Manufacturing capacity growing\n6. Lithium refining in Production\n7. Supercharging growing\n8. Optimus Giga factory being actively built\n9. Battery & cell production growing\n10. Megapack 3 coming\n11. Regional supercharging data centers coming\n12. Tesla AI chip expected to be the best ever\n13. All areas of the business growing\n14. FSD being improved as fast as possible\n15. Quite literally creating a future that doesn't currently exist\n\n■ Why This Frame Matters Today\n\nA counter-narrative to today's analyst downgrade wave. Analysts focus on margin/CAPEX-payback uncertainty; this frame focuses on the breadth of ongoing initiatives. Both are legitimate — analysts price short-term earnings profile, bulls price medium-term optionality.\n\n■ Validation Axis\n\nEach initiative needs to translate into earnings on a real timeline. Cybercab pilot → launch, Semi mass-production SOP, Optimus Gen 3 SOP, Megapack 3 deployments — sequential confirmations will provide quantitative backing to the bull frame.\n\ninvestus.kr SRP Chief Investment Officer",
